OL,3,GNEWSACity's cycle hangars help locals
OL,4,Aget on their bikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FLarge metal storage boxes have recently
OL,7,Fbeen appearing in streets across
OL,8,FSheffield, but what are they actually
OL,9,Ffor?
OL,11,FThese so-called "cycle hangars" - which
OL,12,Fcan hold up to six bikes at a time -
OL,13,Fare part of an ongoing scheme by the
OL,14,Fcity council to make it easier for
OL,15,Fresidents to get more use out of their
OL,16,Fbikes.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
