OL,3,GNEWSACity's cycle hangars help locals
OL,4,Aget on their bikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council says the hangars take up
OL,7,Fless space than a typical parked car
OL,8,Fand have already proved "a great
OL,9,Fsuccess so far", according to city
OL,10,Fcouncillor Alexi Dimond, who adds that
OL,11,Fhangars installed in previous years
OL,12,Fhave been "around 90% full".
OL,14,F"We've also installed Sheffield's first
OL,15,Fpay-by-the-hour cycle hangar on
OL,16,FDevonshire Street in the city centre",
OL,17,FDimond adds.
